@jwtAuth_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059

### 🔐 1. LOGIN → Get JWT Token
POST {{jwtAuth_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

###

### 📋 2. GET ALL EMPLOYEES (Without Token → Should Fail)
GET {{jwtAuth_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Accept: application/json

###

